    {
      "speaker": "あさひ",
      "text": "これっす！ 金色のシールが貼ってあって、限定一個って書いてあるっすよ！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "asahi",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "017",
      "clothId": "017",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 568,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_surp",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
      "lip": "lip_surp",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s1_04",
        "zh": "就是这个！上面还贴着金色贴纸，写着限定最后一份呢！",
        "speakerZh": "芹泽朝日",
        "surfaceEmotion": "surprise_wide",
        "innerEmotion": "alert_spark",
        "vocalTone": "bright_pop",
        "note": "朝日举起金色限定布丁",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "朝日的布丁大发现"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "冬優子",
      "text": "えっ……？ あ、あさひちゃん、今なんて言いましたの……？",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "fuyuko",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "018",
      "clothId": "018",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_surp",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
      "lip": "lip_surp",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s1_05",
        "zh": "诶……？朝、朝日，你刚才说的是什么……？",
        "speakerZh": "黛冬优子",
        "surfaceEmotion": "surprise_wide",
        "innerEmotion": "alert_spark",
        "vocalTone": "bright_pop",
        "note": "冬优子笑容僵住",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "朝日的布丁大发现"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "冬優子",
      "text": "ちょっと待ちなさいよ、あさひ！ それはあとで食べる用に隠しておいた限定品なんだけど！？",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "fuyuko",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "018",
      "clothId": "018",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_anger",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
      "lip": "lip_anger",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s1_06",
        "zh": "你给我等一下啊，朝日！那可是我偷偷藏起来打算晚点吃的限定款好吗！？",
        "speakerZh": "黛冬优子",
        "surfaceEmotion": "anger_pout",
        "innerEmotion": "shy_defensive",
        "vocalTone": "crisp_clipped",
        "note": "冬优子瞬间切回本音吐槽",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "表里人格大危机"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "愛依",
      "text": "あはは、冬優子ちゃんったら顔がいつもの本気モードになってるってば～",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "mei",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "019",
      "clothId": "019",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
      "lip": "lip_smile1",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s1_07",
        "zh": "啊哈哈，冬优子你表情一下切回平时认真模式啦～",
        "speakerZh": "和泉爱依",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "note": "爱依笑著打圆场",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "表里人格大危机"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "あさひ",
      "text": "じゃあ、半分こにすれば問題解決っすね！ スプーン二つ持ってきたっすよ！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "asahi",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "017",
      "clothId": "017",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 568,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s1_08",
        "zh": "那咱们一人一半不就解决啦！我把两把勺子都拿来啰！",
        "speakerZh": "芹泽朝日",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "note": "朝日爽快递出勺子",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "表里人格大危机"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "冬優子",
      "text": "……もう、調子狂うんだから。……仕方ないわね、仲良く分けてあげるわよ",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "fuyuko",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "018",
      "clothId": "018",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait3",
      "charAnim2": "face_close",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
      "lip": "lip_sad",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s1_09",
        "zh": "……真是的，节奏全被你打乱了。……真拿你没办法，就和你们分着吃吧。",
        "speakerZh": "黛冬优子",
        "surfaceEmotion": "troubled_sigh",
        "innerEmotion": "guarded_distance",
        "vocalTone": "sigh_trail",
        "note": "冬优子叹气妥协",
        "x-beatId": "beat_3",
        "x-beatTitle": "表里人格大危机"
      }
